{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33786","headline":"奉酬崔璐进士见寄次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉酬崔璐进士见寄次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊余幼且贱，所禀自以殊。\n弱岁谬知道，有心匡皇符。\n意超海上鹰，运局辕下驹。\n纵性作古文，所谓皆自如。\n但恐才格劣，敢夸词彩敷。\n句句考事实，篇篇穷玄虚。\n谁能变羊质，竞不获骊珠。\n粤有造化手，曾开天地鑪。\n文章邺下秀，气貌淹中儒。\n展我此志业，期君持中枢。\n苍生眼穿望，勿作磻谿谟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}